  - Verification commands must use `uv run`.
- Documentation updated:
  - Added a cross-platform development environment standard to
    `.agents/AGENTS.md`.
  - Added a fresh-checkout rebuild flow for macOS, Linux/Ubuntu, and Windows.
  - Added an Ubuntu quick-start so a future agent can quickly recreate the
    working environment on a new Linux machine.
  - Added a pre-Phase 3 TODO section for environment standardization.
- Local verification performed on this machine:
  - Homebrew install was attempted but failed because `/usr/local/Homebrew` and
    related Homebrew paths were not writable by the current user.
  - Installed `uv` through the official Astral installer into
    `/Users/chchu/.local/bin`.
  - Added uv PATH loading for zsh shell startup files so future shell sessions
    and non-interactive agent commands can resolve `uv`.
  - Installed Python 3.11.15 through `uv` using project-local
    `UV_CACHE_DIR=.uv-cache` and `UV_PYTHON_INSTALL_DIR=.uv-python`.
  - Rebuilt `.venv` with `uv sync --locked`.
- Verification status:
